          "gu_disintegrate_rule_path_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Dong Fang Chang Fan later raises Miniscule Mountain again and uses big to small to weaken Fang Yuan’s six strength path giant hands before breaking them apart.",
